{"title":"Photo Blankets","description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-blankets\"\u003eAll Photo Blankets\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/polar-fleece-photo-blankets\"\u003ePolar Fleece\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/plush-fleece-photo-blankets\"\u003ePlush Fleece\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/hd-woven-photo-blankets\"\u003eHD Woven\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/jacquard-woven-photo-blankets\"\u003eJacquard Woven\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/sherpa-throw-blankets\"\u003eSherpa\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/products\/water-repellent-outdoor-picnic-blanket-50x-59\"\u003ePicnic Blankets\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/themed-designer-blankets\"\u003eThemed Designers\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePersonalized photo throws \u0026amp; blankets\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"jacquard-woven-collage-blanket-70-x-54-large","title":"Jacquard Woven Quick Collage Blanket-6 Image Template- 70\" x 54\" (Large)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA traditional woven blanket created by turning your image into a loom pattern. Three-layer woven, 100% cotton. An instant heirloom! This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 6 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe size indicated includes the fringes. The dimensions do not mean the image itself will be that exact size and additionally there is a 5-7% variance in size due to woven nature of product and cotton shrinkage factors.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 70\u003c\/span\u003e\" x 54\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e100% cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eJacquard Weaving with 100% Cotton Yarn\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-4 Weeks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImage is converted to a 6-color pattern and woven into a blanket. Best suited for closeup images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":37755169027,"sku":"70x54JQW-CLG","price":119.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-jacquard-woven-quick-collage-blanket-70-x-54-large-1.jpg?v=1506961939"},{"product_id":"jacquard-woven-collage-blanket-80-x-54-x-large","title":"Jacquard Woven Quick Collage Blanket -8 Image Template- 80\" x 54\" (X-Large)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA traditional woven blanket created by turning your image into a loom pattern. Three-layer woven, 100% cotton. An instant heirloom! This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 8 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe size indicated includes the fringes. The dimensions do not mean the image itself will be that exact size and additionally there is a 5-7% variance in size due to woven nature of product and cotton shrinkage factors.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 80\u003c\/span\u003e\" x 54\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e100% cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eJacquard Weaving with 100% Cotton Yarn\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-4 Weeks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImage is converted to a 6-color pattern and woven into a blanket. Best suited for closeup images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":37755171395,"sku":"80x54JQW-CLG","price":134.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-jacquard-woven-quick-collage-blanket-80-x-54-x-large-1.jpg?v=1506961902"},{"product_id":"photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30x40","title":"Quick Collage Polar Fleece Blanket-6 Image Template- 30\"x40\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight. 1\/16 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows you to quickly and easily design a 6 image collage with our ready to use template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 260 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41979081667,"sku":"30x40RGF-CLG","price":39.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-quick-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30-x40-1.jpg?v=1506966118"},{"product_id":"photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-60-x-80","title":"Quick Collage Polar Fleece Blanket-12 Image Template- 60\" x 80\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight at only 1\/8 inch thick, with dye sublimated imprint. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows you to quickly and easily design a 12 image collage with our ready to use template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60\" x 80\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 365 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":37755223363,"sku":"60x80RGF-CLG","price":79.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-quick-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-60-x-80-1.jpg?v=1506966037"},{"product_id":"hd-woven-collage-blanket-60-x-54-