roduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eUltra soft and comfy.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture Comparisons:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSoft ribbed knit feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41411921027,"sku":"60x54HDW-KidsArt","price":104.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/kids-creations-turn-your-child-s-drawing-into-a-60-x-54-hd-woven-throw-blanket-1.jpg?v=1506966818"},{"product_id":"60-x-80-heavy-weight-photo-quick-collage-sherpa-throw-blanket","title":"60\" x 80\" Heavy Weight Quick Collage Sherpa Throw Blanket -12 Image Template","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGet a stunning soft blanket that combines quality and comfort with the Heavy Weight Sherpa Lined Sublimated Throw. The top side features silken faux micro mink and the inside is a lusciously soft faux sheepskin Sherpa layer. The whip stitch border gives the blanket a rustic flair. It's made using 100% microfiber polyester fabric. This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 12 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60\" x 80\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eFront\u003c\/i\u003e, Silken Faux Micro Mink (100% Polyester)\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eBack\u003c\/i\u003e, Lusciously Soft Faux Sheepskin (100% Polyester)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eShips out\u003c\/em\u003e in 3 to 5 business days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n","brand":"PersonalThrows","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42272572547,"sku":"60x80SHRPA-CLG","price":99.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/60-x-80-heavy-weight-photo-quick-collage-sherpa-throw-blanket-1.jpg?v=1501187289"},{"product_id":"quick-collage-water-repellent-outdoor-picnic-blanket-50x-59","title":"Quick Collage Water Repellent Outdoor Picnic Blanket -10 Image Template- (50\"x 59\")","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnjoy some fun in the sun while leaving a buffer between you and the ground with this water-repellent microfiber picnic blanket.  This eye-catching 24 oz. piece is made of plush microfiber polyester with a water-repellent polyester oxford lining to help you stay dry. It's also great for camping, trips to the beach, sporting events and much more. This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 10 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50\" x 59\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% Polyester Plush Microfiber Front, Water-Repellent Oxford Lin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42273148803,"sku":"50x59PICNIC-CLG","price":74.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-quick-collage-water-repellent-outdoor-picnic-blanket-50-x-59-1.jpg?v=1506966159"},{"product_id":"full-service-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30x40","title":"Full Service Photo Collage Polar Fleece Blanket - 30\"x40\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight. 1\/16 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Makes a great throw or picnic blanket. This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 6 image collage!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 260 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e Allows up to 6 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42805874115,"sku":"30x40RGF-CLGFS","price":69.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-full-service-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-30-x40-1.jpg?v=1501708220"},{"product_id":"full-service-photo-collage-plush-fleece-blanket-30-x-40","title":"Full Service Photo Collage Plush Fleece Blanket - 30\" x 40\"","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA slightly snugglier option than our Polar Fleece – thicker and fuzzier. 1\/4 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Great for chilly plane cabins or car rides.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAnti Pill 400 GSM Coral fleece (100% Polyester)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u00