u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e100% cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eJacquard Weaving with 100% Cotton Yarn\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-4 Weeks.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImage is converted to a 6-color pattern and woven into a blanket. Best suited for closeup images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAllows for up to 4 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42807414595,"sku":"54x38JQW-CLGFS","price":114.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-jacquard-woven-full-service-collage-blanket-54-x-38-small-1.jpg?v=1506961515"},{"product_id":"jacquard-woven-full-service-collage-blanket-60-x-54-medium","title":"Jacquard Woven Full Service Collage Blanket - 60\" x 54\" (Medium)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA traditional woven blanket created by turning your image into a loom pattern. Three-layer woven, 100% cotton. An instant heirloom!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe size indicated includes the fringes. The dimensions do not mean the image itself will be that exact size and additionally there is a 5-7% variance in size due to woven nature of product and cotton shrinkage factors.\u00