bines quality and comfort with the Heavy Weight Sherpa Lined Sublimated Throw. The top side features silken faux micro mink and the inside is a lusciously soft faux sheepskin Sherpa layer. The whip stitch border gives the blanket a rustic flair. It's made using 100% microfiber polyester fabric.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50\" x 60\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eFront\u003c\/i\u003e, Silken Faux Micro Mink (100% Polyester)\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003eBack\u003c\/i\u003e, Lusciously Soft Faux Sheepskin (100% Polyester)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003eShips out\u003c\/em\u003e in 3 to 5 business days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAllows for up to 10 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42806864387,"sku":"50x60SHRPA-CLGFS","price":86.36,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-50-x-60-heavy-weight-photo-full-service-collage-sherpa-throw-blanket-1.jpg?v=1501708323"},{"product_id":"full-service-photo-collage-polar-fleece-blanket-60-x