003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaximum No. Images:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAllows for up to 10 images.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis is a full-service collage layout set up by our art team. Proofing is included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42806668099,"sku":"50x60PLF-CLGFS","price":104.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-full-service-photo-collage-plush-fleece-blanket-50-x-60-1.jpg?v=1501708280"},{"product_id":"polar-fleece-mini-photo-blanket-30-x-40","title":"Polar Fleece Mini Photo Blanket - 30\" x 40\"","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur basic option - soft, smooth and lightweight. 1\/16 inch thick, dye sublimation imprinted. Makes a great baby blanket for the summer months or warm climates.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30\" x 40\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Anti Pill 260 GSM Polar fleece (100% Polyester) - Thin, Low Pile\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Brushed on both sides for soft feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSet it up with a single image or a collage!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e  \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v