li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Poly\/Cotton, 3-layer Woven Blanket\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ultra soft and comfy.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture Comparisons:\u003c\/strong\u003e Soft ribbed knit feel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSet it up with a single image or a collage!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e  \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":37948448707,"sku":"70x54HDW","price":114.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-blankets-holiday-gifts-mother-s-day-gifts-hd-woven-photo-blanket-70-x-54-x-large-1.jpg?v=1506961481"},{"product_id":"jacquard-woven-photo-blanket-70-x-54-large","title":"Jacquard Woven Photo Blanket - 70\" x 54\" (Large)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA traditional woven blanket created by turning your image into a loom pattern. Three-layer woven, 100% cotton. An instant heirloom!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 85%;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe size indicated includes the fringes. The dimensions do not mean the image itself will be that exact size and additionally there is a 5-7% variance in size due to woven nature of product and cotton shrinkage factors.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70\" x 54\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% cotton\u0